WEBVTT

00:00:00.104 --> 00:00:10.688
This video shows how to log in to Education AI on your phone. You will open the sign-in page, enter your username and password, and arrive on your dashboard.

00:00:13.636 --> 00:00:23.548
Open your school's Education AI link in your phone's browser. On the sign-in page, tap the Username box and type the username your school gave you.

00:00:25.632 --> 00:00:36.432
Next, tap the Password box and type your password. For your safety the password stays hidden while you type, and you can tap the eye icon if you want to check it.

00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:50.165
Now tap Sign In. After a moment you land on your dashboard, which is the home screen of the whole app. Tap the menu button at the top left whenever you want to move to another section.

00:00:52.555 --> 00:00:58.195
That is all it takes. You are now logged in and ready to start working.
